{"ID":"20240205153906-3xwhtah","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153906-3xwhtah","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153906-3xwhtah\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205161555-mlfpgko\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162634-4k253bi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205161551-4g5cagf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"生姜","type":"doc","updated":"20240902110754"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206092111-kjcgguk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092111-kjcgguk","updated":"20240206092143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t全国各地均产。\n【性状】\t生姜呈不规则的块状，略扁，肉质肥厚。表面黄褐色或灰棕色，质脆，易折断，断面黄色，内皮层有明显环纹。气香特异，味辛辣。\n【性味】\t辛，微温。\n【功效】\t发汗解表，温中止呕，温肺止咳，解鱼蟹毒，解药毒。\n【炙品】\t鲜姜粉：取鲜生姜，洗净，捣烂，压榨取汁，静置，分取沉淀的粉质，晒干，或低温干燥。\n炮姜：取生姜，砂烫至鼓起，表面棕褐色。质轻泡，断面细颗粒性，中心棕黄色，边缘棕黑色。味微辛，辣。温中散寒，温经止血。用于脾胃虚寒，腹痛吐泻，吐衄崩漏，阳虚失血。\n煨姜：取净生姜，用纸六、七层包裹，水中浸透，置火灰中煨至纸色焦黄，去纸用。"}]},{"ID":"20240206092110-972xyl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092110-972xyl9","updated":"20240206092110"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092110-5r6kyzv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240206092121-75tkrcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206092121-75tkrcf","updated":"20240206092122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206092122-b6tcftz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155203-d2uf72o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155203-d2uf72o","updated":"20240205155203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"生姜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/生姜-20240205155203-c2qciyk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-3kjvrkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-3kjvrkn","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 430px;","style":"width: 420px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624104536-gocxqa1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 420px;\" parent-style=\"width: 430px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902105937-qc4q05u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105937-qc4q05u","updated":"20240902105937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"生姜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/生姜-20240813140814-du9yp77.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 682px;","style":"width: 672px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"生姜 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/生姜 1-20240813141032-ay75p3u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 672px;\" parent-style=\"width: 682px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-zvj385r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-zvj385r","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"姜 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/姜 2-20240717143441-w43mn73.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 543px;","style":"width: 533px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"姜 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/姜 3-20240717143519-junqd7e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 533px;\" parent-style=\"width: 543px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-t7jcsg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-t7jcsg1","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 624px;","style":"width: 614px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"姜 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/姜 1-20240717143351-j36nrw5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 614px;\" parent-style=\"width: 624px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 568px;","style":"width: 558px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"姜 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/姜 4-20240717143604-xoc1qr6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 558px;\" parent-style=\"width: 568px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902105953-tyg44id","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902105953-tyg44id","updated":"20240902105953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 389px;","style":"width: 379px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"生姜 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/生姜 2-20240813141214-b69vo4f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 379px;\" parent-style=\"width: 389px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 768px;","style":"width: 758px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"生姜 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/生姜 3-20240813141255-wn2zytx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 758px;\" parent-style=\"width: 768px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-ajc50nk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-ajc50nk","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 399px;","style":"width: 389px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"姜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/姜-20240717143327-p83vhg6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 389px;\" parent-style=\"width: 399px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-kqpue5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-kqpue5c","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（以上为一些生姜本草杂图）"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-wa365tk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-wa365tk","updated":"20240717143715"}},{"ID":"20240717143715-ocm7rba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-ocm7rba","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大姜"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-atle8ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-atle8ir","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 635px;","style":"width: 625px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大姜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大姜-20240717142241-or3crme.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 625px;\" parent-style=\"width: 635px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 583px;","style":"width: 573px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大姜 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大姜 1-20240717142333-c10sk4y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 573px;\" parent-style=\"width: 583px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-c3fbhh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-c3fbhh9","updated":"20240717143715"}},{"ID":"20240717143715-2lpdten","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-2lpdten","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小黄姜"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-n281kwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-n281kwe","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 811px;","style":"width: 801px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小黄姜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小黄姜-20240717141044-uizn2iq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 801px;\" parent-style=\"width: 811px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 390px;","style":"width: 380px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小黄姜 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小黄姜 1-20240717141156-iikcp80.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 380px;\" parent-style=\"width: 390px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-tlbrkrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-tlbrkrz","updated":"20240902110108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小黄姜 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小黄姜 2-20240717142907-rdx7r43.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小黄姜"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小黄姜-20240902110046-2zacg4a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717143715-zttygzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717143715-zttygzk","updated":"20240717143715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 555px;","style":"width: 545px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"姜花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/姜花-20240624105053-wxuzz75.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 545px;\" parent-style=\"width: 555px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717145725-qoinfir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717145725-qoinfir","updated":"20240717145805"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：真正的干姜，是母子姜栽地里后，外面的子姜长大了，里头那个母姜干瘪了，那块母姜就是干姜——张志顺道长。（这个不是张道长原话，因为口音问题，尽量在不改变原意的前提下转义，更好阅读理解）"}]},{"ID":"20240717145725-dm67sfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717145725-dm67sfr","updated":"20240717145725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：姜切成片，走肺经，切成丝，走心脏；——张志顺道长。"}]},{"ID":"20240717145725-az6fmxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717145725-az6fmxt","updated":"20240717145725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三注：煨姜就是姜用泥包住，搁火里头烧干的那个叫煨姜。胃大热需要下凉药时，考虑胃不能受凉东西，这时候就要下煨姜。煨姜能护住胃，当服用凉药来治胃热时，凉药的药性都结束离开胃了，煨姜的药性都还能够保持在胃中。——张志顺。（这个不是张道长原话，因为口音问题，尽量在不改变原意的前提下转义，更好阅读理解）"}]},{"ID":"20240717143717-8ny26p0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717143717-8ny26p0"}},{"ID":"20240902110746-bfnlnnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-bfnlnnb","updated":"20240902110754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：生姜"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-sulnv4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-sulnv4u","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生姜《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-fplj7aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-fplj7aw","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShēnɡJiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-ev1a10l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-ev1a10l","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RHIZOMAZINGIBERISRECENS"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-jswlpoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-jswlpoc","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】姜"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-rg9wmw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-rg9wmw2","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为姜科植物姜ZingiberofficinaleRosc.的新鲜根茎。秋、冬二季采挖，除去须根及泥沙。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-nu1jihb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-nu1jihb","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈不规则块状，略扁，具指状分枝，长4～18cm，厚1～3cm。表面黄褐色或灰棕色，有环节，分枝顶端有茎痕或芽。质脆，易折断，断面浅黄色，内皮层环纹明显，维管束散在。气香特异，味辛辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-dsnaoda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-dsnaoda","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】生姜：除去杂质，洗净，用时切厚片。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-pr23xef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-pr23xef","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-7cj2yho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-7cj2yho","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、脾、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-n6l5sg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-n6l5sg3","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】解表散寒，温中止呕，化痰止咳。用于风寒感冒，胃寒呕吐，寒痰咳嗽。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-ljupyf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-ljupyf0","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-hclbg3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-hclbg3c","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置阴凉潮湿处，或埋入湿沙内，防冻。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-usv4g6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-usv4g6c","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-0nmzkaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-0nmzkaw","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）生姜用于解表，主要为发散风寒，多用治感冒轻症，煎汤，加红糖乘热服用，往往能得汗而解，也可用作预防感冒药物。生姜发汗作用较弱，常配合麻黄、桂枝等同用，作为发汗解表辅助的药品，能增强发汗力量。生姜为止呕要药，可单独应用，治疗胃寒呕吐。也可治胃热呕吐，配合半夏、竹茹、黄连等同用。生姜能解鱼蟹毒，单用或配紫苏同用。此外，生姜又能解生半夏、生南星之毒，煎汤饮服，可用于中半夏、南星毒引起的喉哑舌肿麻木等症。因此在炮制半夏、南星的时候，常用生姜同制，以减除它们的毒性。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-ulg4nwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-ulg4nwk","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）生姜汁：将生姜洗净后打烂，绞取其汁入药。性味辛微温。有化痰、止呕的功效，主要用于恶心呕吐及咳嗽痰多等症。一般用量为三滴至十滴，冲服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-9o8eex2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-9o8eex2","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）生姜皮：即生姜的外皮。性味辛凉。有利尿消肿之功效，适用于小便不利，水肿等症，可配合冬瓜皮、桑白皮等同用。一般用量为五分至一钱五分，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-98eq94m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-98eq94m","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）煨姜：将原只鲜生姜洗净，用草纸包裹，放在清水中浸湿，直接放在火中煨，待草纸焦黑，姜熟为度；或直接放火中烤熟。性味辛温，具有和中止呕的功用。适用于脾胃不和、恶心呕吐等症。一般用量为二、三片，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-x2g2xyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-x2g2xyh","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-8x6jmgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-8x6jmgv","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生姜《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-qplu3yn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-qplu3yn","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-bh3u6io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-bh3u6io","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShēnɡJiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-g8rmad1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-g8rmad1","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为姜科植物姜的鲜根茎。夏季采挖，除去茎叶及须根，洗净泥土。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-hdanr2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-hdanr2k","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-09bvqlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-09bvqlm","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"姜（《吕氏春秋》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-bnntcoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-bnntcoc","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生草本，高40～100厘米。根茎肉质，扁圆横走，分枝，具芳香和辛辣气味。叶互生，2列，无柄，有长鞘，抱茎；叶片线状披针形，长15～20厘米，宽约2厘米，先端渐尖，基部狭，光滑无毛；叶舌长1～3毫米，膜质。花茎自根茎抽出，长约20厘米；穗状花序椭圆形，稠密，长约5厘米，宽约2.5厘米；苞片卵圆形，长约2.5厘米，先端具硬尖，绿白色，背面边缘黄色；花萼管状，长约1厘米，具3短齿；花冠绿黄色，管长约2厘米，裂片3，披针形，略等长，唇瓣长圆状倒卵形，较花冠裂片短，稍为紫色，有黄白色斑点；雄蕊微紫色，与唇瓣等长；子房无毛，3室，花柱单生，为花药所抱持。蒴果3瓣裂，种子黑色。花期7～8月（栽培的很少开花）。果期12月至翌年1月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-nnjxs5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-nnjxs5j","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物干燥的根茎（干姜）、根茎的栓皮（姜皮）、叶（姜叶）亦供药用，各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-tuy972x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-tuy972x","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】全国大部分地区有栽培。全国大部分地区有产，主产四川、广东、山东、陕西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-udhk7xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-udhk7xv","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】鲜根茎为扁平不规则的块状，并有枝状分枝，各柱顶端有茎痕或芽，表面黄白色或灰白色，有光泽，具浅棕色环节。质脆，折断后有汁液渗出；断面浅黄色，有一明显环纹，中间稍现筋脉。气芳香而特殊，味辛辣。以块大、丰满、质嫩者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-wjdbwtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-wjdbwtp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】生姜：拣去杂质，洗净泥土，用时切片。鲜姜粉：取鲜生姜，洗净，捣烂，压榨取汁，静置，分取沉淀的粉质，晒干，或低温干燥。煨姜：取净生姜，用纸六，七层包裹，水中浸透，置火灰中煨至纸色焦黄，去纸用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-qgqirwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-qgqirwk","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-3lccz0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-3lccz0g","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-avm4kmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-avm4kmy","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"味辛，微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-slvcusv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-slvcusv","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《千金·食治》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-mbd722c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-mbd722c","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《医学启源》：\"性温，味甘辛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-oroge8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-oroge8v","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《医林纂要》：\"煨姜，辛苦，大热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-vp9q904","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-vp9q904","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草再新》：\"煨姜，味辛，性温平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-kdnqyqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-kdnqyqv","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-jz71a7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-jz71a7u","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肺、胃、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-sgxjjp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-sgxjjp5","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入肺、心、脾、胃四经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-3gsglg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-3gsglg7","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草汇言》：\"入脾、肺、肠、胃诸经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-lbm3y3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-lbm3y3f","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经解》：\"入胆、肝、肺经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-i3t89bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-i3t89bw","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-d0ylfyk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-d0ylfyk","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"发表，散寒，止呕，开痰。治感冒风寒，呕吐，痰饮，喘咳，胀满，泄泻；解半夏、天南星及鱼蟹、鸟兽肉毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-fid8lpt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-fid8lpt","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"去臭气，通神明。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-wkj05ku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-wkj05ku","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"主伤寒头痛鼻塞，咳逆上气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-siesqin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-siesqin","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③陶弘景：\"归五脏，去痰下气，止呕吐，除风湿寒热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-k8mue8u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-k8mue8u","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药性论》：\"主痰水气满，下气；生与干并治嗽，疗时疾，止呕吐不下食。生和半夏主心下急痛；若中热不能食，捣汁和蜜服之。又汁和杏仁作煎，下一切结气实，心胸拥隔，冷热气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-5zcdv9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-5zcdv9q","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《千金·食治》：\"通汗，去膈上臭气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-yripjo8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-yripjo8","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《食疗本草》：\"除壮热，治转筋、心满。\"\"止逆，散烦闷，开胃气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-qmidunu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-qmidunu","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《本草拾遗》：\"汁解毒药，破血调中，去冷除痰，开胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-2baldvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-2baldvz","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《珍珠囊》：\"益脾胃，散风寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-wuh6kbu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-wuh6kbu","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《医学启源》：\"温中去湿。制厚朴、半夏毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-m2dyfck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-m2dyfck","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩《日用本草》：\"治伤寒、伤风、头痛、九窍不利。入肺开胃，去腹中寒气，解臭秽。\"解菌蕈诸物毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-9erjszy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-9erjszy","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾《纲目》：\"生用发散，熟用和中，解食野禽中毒成喉痹；浸汁点赤眼；捣汁和黄明胶熬，贴风湿痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-vtsitpx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-vtsitpx","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿《本草从新》：\"姜汁，开痰，治噎膈反胃，救暴卒，疗狐臭，搽冻耳。煨姜，和中止呕。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-d03ki6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-d03ki6x","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀《会约医镜》：\"煨姜，治胃寒，泄泻，吞酸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-2f9uhor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-2f9uhor","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁《现代实用中药》：\"治肠疝痛有效。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-lr5c46h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-lr5c46h","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～3钱；或捣汁。外用：捣敷，擦患处或炒热熨。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-x16go5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-x16go5u","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-e4qegvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-e4qegvi","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阴虚内热者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-vro5bls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-vro5bls","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"食姜久，积热患目。凡病痔人多食兼酒，立发甚速。痈疮人多食则生恶肉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-p8r9rd0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-p8r9rd0","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"久服损阴伤目，阴虚内热，阴虚咳嗽吐血，表虚有热汗出，自汗盗汗，脏毒下血，因热呕恶，火热腹痛，法韭忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-ezouo59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-ezouo59","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《随息居饮食谱》：\"内热阴虚，目赤喉患，血证疮痛，呕泻有火，暑热时症，热哮大喘，胎产痧胀及时病后、痧痘后均忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-y4onz2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-y4onz2o","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-kgqaetp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-kgqaetp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治感冒风寒：生姜五片，紫苏叶一两。水煎服。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-0mwnnoe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-0mwnnoe","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治呕吐，百药不差：生姜一两，切如绿豆大，以醋浆七合，于银器煎取四合，空腹和滓旋呷之。（《食医心镜》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-fm93tfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-fm93tfm","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治病人胸中似喘不喘，似呕不呕，似哕不哕，心中愤愤然无奈者：半夏半升，生姜汁一升。上二味以水三升，煮半夏取二升，内生姜汁，煮取一升半，小冷。分四服，日三夜一服，止，停后服。（《金匮要赂》生姜半夏汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-jfplfe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-jfplfe9","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治冷痰嗽：生姜二两，饧糖一两。水三碗，煎至半碗，温和徐徐饮。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-8tp7slq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-8tp7slq","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治三十年咳嗽：白蜜一斤，生姜二斤（取汁）。上二味，先秤铜铫知斤两讫，内蜜复秤知数，次内姜汁以微火煎，令姜汁尽，惟有蜜斤两在，止。旦服如枣犬，含一丸，日三服。禁一切杂食。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-l2orvp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-l2orvp0","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治劳嗽：蜂蜜、姜汁各四两，白萝卜汁、梨汁、人乳各一碗。共熬成膏，早晚滚汤服数匙。（《经验广集》五汁膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-u044bcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-u044bcp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治伤寒汗出，解之后，胃中不和，心下痞梗，干噫食臭，胁下有水气，腹中雷鸣下利者：生姜（切）四两，甘草（炙）三两，人参三两，干姜一两，黄芩三两，半夏（洗）半升，黄连一两，大枣（擘）十二枚。上八味，以水一斗，煮取六升，去滓，再煎取三升。温服一升，日三服。（《伤寒论》生姜泻心汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-e1vkhb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-e1vkhb3","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治心胸胁下有邪气结实，硬痛胀满者：生姜一斤，捣渣，留汁，慢炒待润；以绢包，于患处款款熨之，冷，再以汁炒，再熨良久，豁然宽快也。（《伤寒六书》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-wepp27n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-wepp27n","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治霍乱心腹胀痛，烦满短气，未得吐下：生姜一斤。切，以水七升，煮取二升，分作三服。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-rksaee4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-rksaee4","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩风湿痹痛：生姜汁和黄明胶熬贴。（《本草从新》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-dz0xj6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-dz0xj6t","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治中气昏厥，亦有痰闭者：生姜五钱，半夏、陈皮、木香各一钱五分，甘草八分。水煎，临服时加童便一盏。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-sw9p6nq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-sw9p6nq","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治时行寒疟：生姜四两，白术二两，草果仁一两。水五大碗，煎至二碗，未发时早饮。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-d4wfeak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-d4wfeak","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治胃气虚，风热，不能食：姜汁半鸡子壳，生地黄汁少许，蜜一匙头。和水三合，顿服。（《食疗本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-hqdq6nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-hqdq6nx","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治腹满不能服药：煨生姜，绵裹纳下部中，冷即易之。（《梅师集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-v0wqwuc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-v0wqwuc","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治手脱皮：鲜姜一两。切片，用酒二两单，浸二十四小时后，涂搽局部，一日二次。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-m5atzer","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-m5atzer","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃治秃头：生姜捣烂，加温，敷头上，约二、三次。（《贵州中医验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-pb4e7l6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-pb4e7l6","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治诸疮痔漏，久不结痂：生姜连皮切大片，涂白矾末，炙焦研细，贴之勿动。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-80rlwlr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-80rlwlr","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治发背初起：生姜一块，炭火炙一层刮一层，为末，以猪胆汁调涂。（《海上方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-htona36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-htona36","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治赤白癜风：生姜频擦之良。（《易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-hgbjuyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-hgbjuyw","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒇治猘犬咬人，重发：捣姜根汁饮之。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-d5qe3rt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-d5qe3rt","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（21）治蝮蛇毒：末姜薄之，干复易。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-o994b9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-o994b9z","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（22）治跌扑伤损：姜汁和酒调生面贴之。（《易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-jbq6csa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-jbq6csa","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（23）牙齿疼痛，日夜呻吟：老生姜切片，安瓦上，用炭火，却将白矾掺姜上，候焦为末，擦疼处。（《海上方》赴筵散，又名晋矾散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-a440juo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-a440juo","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（24）治百虫入耳：姜汁少许滴之。（《易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-hwwewsg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-hwwewsg","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-9chbpkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-9chbpkx","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治风湿痛、腰腿痛"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-jlxl2sh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-jlxl2sh","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用鲜生姜制成5～10％注射液，行痛点或反应结节注射，亦可配合远端或近端穴位注射，如关节部位则在关节囊周围注射。每点注入0.5～2毫升，每日或隔日1次，3～5次为一疗程，一般可连续注射20～30次。注射后局部常有胀、麻及灼热感，甚至疼痛加剧，约1～2天便减轻或消失。据观察，反应愈重效果愈佳。用于风湿痛、慢性腰背痛113例，显效36例，好转56例，有效率83％；尤以对风湿痛疗效更佳，有效率达92.5％；治疗风湿性关节炎38例，治愈14例，显效15例，有效6例。有效病例用药后疼痛减轻或消失，关节肿胀消退或好转，功能恢复或改善。还曾试用于小儿麻痹症，亦有一定效果。此外，用生姜、麻油制成生姜曲注射剂行穴位注射，对风湿痛或腰腿痛也有疗效。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-mop0n5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-mop0n5l","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治胃、十二指肠溃疡"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-13zqa2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-13zqa2h","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"据数十例的观察，对改善症状有较好效果：服药后能使疼痛减轻或消失，随之反酸、饥饿感也见好转，便秘及黑粪转为正常，食欲增加。但多不能根治，常易复发；对一部分患者能遗留下较长的胃部堵塞感。用法：鲜生姜60克，洗净切碎，加水300毫升，煎30分钟。每日3次，2日服完。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-oum1tle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-oum1tle","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疗疟疾"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-mt6p3kz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-mt6p3kz","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鲜生姜洗净拭干，切碎捣烂，摊于纱布块上，再包叠成小方块，敷贴于穴位上，用胶布固定或绷带包扎。选用穴位计分3组：第1组为双侧膝眼，生姜用2两分敷两穴；第2组为大椎加间使（双侧），生姜用1两分敷3穴；第3组选大椎1穴，生姜用5钱。一般于发作前4～6小时敷贴，经8～12小时即可取下，敷药两次即可。观察40例，除第1、第3两组各有2例无效外，其余均控制发作，血检疟原虫阴性。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-b7yhbho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-b7yhbho","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疗急性细菌性痢疾"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-w3nyyyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-w3nyyyq","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用鲜生姜1.5两，红糖1两，共捣为糊状，每日3次分服，7天为一疗程。据50例观察，治愈率为70％，好转率为30％。用药后腹痛、里急后重平均消失时间分别为5.16天和5.14天，大便外观及次数恢复正常分别为4.8天和5.2天，大便镜检及培养平均转阴日数分别为4.58天和3.6天。治疗中未见明显副作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-hwumusw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-hwumusw","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治疗蛔虫性肠梗阻"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-65cnzgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-65cnzgg","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取鲜生姜2两，捣烂取汁，加蜜糖至60毫升；1～4岁30～40毫升，5～6岁50毫升，7～13岁50～60毫升，分2～3次口服。或用生姜1两捣汁，加入蜂蜜60毫升为1剂；1～2岁服1／4剂，2～4岁服1／3，剂，4～7岁服1／2剂，7～14岁服2／3剂，14岁以上服1剂。服药后患儿一般即不感腹痛，呕吐停止，包块通常于服药后1～3天消失。包块消失后即可服驱蛔药物。如服姜蜜后腹痛仍不止，可用冬眠灵、阿托品等解痉止痛；腹胀明显者应行胃肠减压，姜蜜合剂可从胃管注入，注入后夹住胃管2～3小时；呕吐重者注意纠正水、电解质的紊乱；如有腹胀发热，须加用抗菌素，并严密观察病情变化，如肠鸣音消失需及时考虑手术治疗；给药12～24小时后仍未见效者，可用10％盐水行低位灌肠，或内服中药。曾按上述方法分别观察52例和109例，结果除有5例系回盲部蛔虫团阻塞、阑尾蛔虫症及并发穿孔改为手术治疗外，全部治愈。平均住院时间分别为3.2天和2.4天。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-xmu1es6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-xmu1es6","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治疗急性睾丸炎"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-hy1ptxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-hy1ptxc","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取肥大的老生姜，用水洗净，横切成约0.2厘米厚的均匀薄片，每次用6～10片外敷于患侧阴囊，并盖上纱布，兜起阴囊，每日或隔日更换1次，直到痊愈为止。据观察，敷药后患者都感阴囊表皮灼热刺疼、发麻发辣，少数发生红肿，个别发生红疹。共治24例，敷药第2天15例自觉坠胀疼痛及触痛减轻，睾丸肿胀显著消退；第3天有12例痊愈，自觉症消失，睾丸消肿，触疼消失；4天后4例痊愈；5例在敷药后5天痊愈。治愈天数平均为3.9天。对照组4例（兜起阴囊热敷，服磺胺类药及注射青霉素），平均治愈天数为8.5天。本法对阴囊局部皮肤有创口或因睾丸炎化脓穿溃者不能应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-1t2xz5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-1t2xz5n","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦用于中毒急救"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-cpsq7in","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-cpsq7in","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于半夏、乌头、闹羊花、木薯、百部等中毒，均可用生姜急救。曾有报道，4例南星中毒患者，用生姜后均获痊愈。用法：轻者急用生姜汁含漱，并口服5毫升，以后每隔4小时续服5毫升；中毒严重神志昏迷者，立即鼻饲25％干姜汤60毫升，以后每3小时灌入鲜姜汁5毫升。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-owpl7xy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-owpl7xy","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，试用生姜揩擦治疗白癜风，生姜浸酒涂擦鹅掌风及甲癣均有一定效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-7ejba32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-7ejba32","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-rc2pfc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-rc2pfc2","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生姜《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-v0y9sfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-v0y9sfx","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-ie1f68o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-ie1f68o","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自1.《本草经集注》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-iu4bnw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-iu4bnw3","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草图经》：生姜，生犍为山谷及荆州、扬州。今处处有之，以汉、温、池州者为良。苗高二、三尺，叶似箭竹而长，两两相对，苗青，根黄，无花实。秋采根，于长流水洗过，日晒为干姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-ad2w2jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-ad2w2jp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草衍义》：生姜，治暴逆气，嚼三、两皂子大，下咽定，屡服屡定。初得寒热痰嗽，烧一块含啮之，终日间嗽自愈。暴赤眼无疮者，以古铜钱刮净姜上，取汁于钱唇点目，热泪出，今日点，来日愈。但小"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-vnscusx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-vnscusx","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】ShēnɡJiānɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-ay8jl10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-ay8jl10","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】FreshGinger,CommonGinger,Gingerrace,Gingerjuice"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-h8b6oy5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-h8b6oy5","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】姜根、百辣云、勾装指、因地辛、炎凉小子、鲜生姜、蜜炙姜、生姜汁、姜"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-1fx5m7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-1fx5m7d","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-06nc89f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-06nc89f","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为姜科植物姜的新鲜根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-w5yfuq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-w5yfuq7","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：ZingiberofficinaleRosc."}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-xyudwxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-xyudwxp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：10-12月茎叶枯黄时采收。挖起根茎，去掉茎叶、须根。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-d22wibe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-d22wibe","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】姜，多年生草本，高50-80cm。根茎肥厚，断面黄白色，有浓厚的辛辣气味。叶互生，排成2列，无柄，几抱茎；叶舌长2-4mm；叶片披针形至线状披针形，长15-30cm，宽1.5-2.2cm，先端渐尖，基部狭，叶革鞘状抱茎，无毛。花葶自根茎中抽出，长15-25cm；穗状花序椭圆形，长4-5cm；苞片卵形，长约2.5cm，淡绿色，边缘淡黄色，先端有小尖头；花萼管长约1cm，具3短尖齿；花冠黄绿色，管长2-2.5cm，裂片3，披针形，长不及2cm，唇瓣的中间裂片长圆状倒卵开，较花冠裂片短，有紫色条纹和淡黄色斑点，两侧裂片卵形，黄绿色，具紫色边缘；雄蕊1，暗紫色，花药长约9m，药隔附属体包裹住花柱；子房3室，无毛，花柱1，柱头近球形。蒴果。种子多数，黑色。花期8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-eg05ow2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-eg05ow2","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】我国中部、东南部至西南部各少广为栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-bd5c8xn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-bd5c8xn","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-cejezgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-cejezgp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜温暖湿润的气候，不耐寒，怕潮湿，怕强光直射。忌连作。宜选择坡地和稍阴的地块栽培。以上层深厚、疏松、肥沃、排水良好的砂壤上至重壤上为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-vz8lwpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-vz8lwpl","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用根茎（种姜）繁殖，穴栽或条栽。秋季采挖生姜时，选择肥厚、色浅黄。有光泽、无病虫伤疤的根茎作种姜，下窖贮藏或在室内与细沙分层堆放贮藏备用。南方于1-4月，北方于5月，取出种差保温催芽，然后把种姜切成小块，每块保留1-2个壮芽。穴栽按行株距40cm×30cm开穴，深13-17cm，先浇粪水于穴中，待渗透土后，每穴平放种姜1块，最后覆盖细堆肥与土。条栽按行距40cm开沟，施入基肥后，按株距27cm下种，上覆土与地面平。四川产区很注意播种的深浅度，播种深（挖穴30cm左右），并不断培土而成某姜，为生姜来源；播种浅（挖穴5-10cm）而成药姜，为干姜来源。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-gxqa490","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-gxqa490","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理出苗后发现缺株，及时补栽。全年中耕除草3-4次，追肥4次，肥料以有机肥和复合肥为主。生长期间对水分要求比较严格，不能缺水，出现厂导要及时浇水保湿，收获前10d停止浇水。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-q1ub5hj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-q1ub5hj","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治病害有腐败病，俗称姜温，高温多雨季节易发病。用波尔多液浸种10min，发病时拔除病株，用石灰撒病穴消毒。虫害有亚洲玉米螟，8-9月为害姜的茎秆。用90%敌百虫1000液灌心叶。姜弄蝶，以幼虫为害叶片。用80%敌敌畏1500倍液喷杀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-2ga2b76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-2ga2b76","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-n0gm81x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-n0gm81x","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别，根茎呈不规则块状，略扁，具指状分枝，长4-18cm，厚1-3cm。表面黄褐色或灰棕色，有环节，分枝顶端有茎痕或芽。质脆，晚折断，断面浅黄色，内皮层环纹明显，维管束散在。气香，特异味辛辣。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-srv6gmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-srv6gmq","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别根茎横切面：木柱层为多列扁平木柱细胞。皮层散列多数叶迹维管束；内皮层明显，可见凯氏带。中柱占根茎的大部分，散列多数外韧型维管束，近中往鞘处维管束形小，排列较紧密，木质部内侧或周围有非木化的纤维束。本品薄壁组织中散有油细胞。薄壁细胞含淀粉粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-u518hgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-u518hgp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-sqhcbo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-sqhcbo4","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生姜含挥发性成分：α-姜烯(α-zingiberene)，β-檀香萜醇(β-santalol)，β-水芹烯(β-phellandrene)，β-甜没药烯(β-bisabolene)，α-姜黄烯(α-curcumene)，姜醇(zingiberol)，紫苏醛(perillaldehyde)，橙花醛(neral)，牻牛儿醛(geranial)，2-蒈醇(2-caraneol)，3-蒈醇，樟烯(camphene)，β-罗勒烯(β-ocimene)，α-香柑油烯(α-bergamotene)，β-金便欢烯(β-farnesene)，月桂烯(myrcene)，β-蒎烯(β-pinene)，2-龙脑(2-borneol)，柠檬醛(citral),7-孟烯[7-menthene]，异小茴香醇(isofenchylalcohol)，α-金合欢烯，1，3，3-三甲基三环[2.2.1.02,6]-庚烷[1，3，3-trimethyltricyclo[2.2.1.02,6]heptane]，2，6-二甲基-6-(4-甲基-3-戊烯基)-二环[3.1.1]-2-庚烷[2，6-dimethyl-6-(4-methyl-3-pentenyl)-bicyclo[3.1.1]-2-heptene]，1，3，3-三甲基-2-氧杂二环[2.2.2]辛烷[1，3，3-trimethyl-2-oxabicyclo[2.2.2]octane]，1-（1，5-二甲基-4-已烯基）-4-甲基苯[1-(1,5-eimethyl-4-hexenyl)-4-methylbenzene]及高良姜萜内酯(galanolactone)等数十种；辛辣成分：6-姜辣醇(6-gingerol)，3-姜辣醇，4-姜辣醇，5-姜辣醇，8-姜辣醇，10-姜辣醇，12-姜辣醇，6-姜辣二醇(6-gingediol)，4-姜辣二醇，8-姜辣二醇，10-姜辣二醇，6-甲基姜辣二醇(6-gingediol)，4-姜辣二醇，8-姜辣二醇，10-姜辣二醇，6-甲基姜辣二醇(6-methylgingediol)，4-姜辣二醇双乙酸酯(4-gingediacetate)，6-姜辣二醇双乙酸酯，6-甲基姜二醇双乙酸(6-methylgingediacetate)，6-姜辣二酮(6-gingerdione)，10-姜辣二酮，6-去氢姜辣二酮(6-dehydrogingerdiong)，10-去氢姜辣二酮，6-乙酰姜辣醇(6-acetylgingerol)，6-姜辣烯酮(6-shogaol)等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-oxi9cyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-oxi9cyp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生姜还含呋喃大牻牛儿酮(furanogermenone)，2-哌啶酸(pipecolicacid)及天冬氨酸(asparticacid)，谷氨酸(glutamicacid)，丝氨酸(serine)等多种氨基酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-pn1g7rv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-pn1g7rv","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-qauhu1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-qauhu1p","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.对消化系统的作用：对装有隔离小胃及食道瘘的狗，用50%煎剂置于口腔中，可对胃酸及胃液的分泌呈双相作用，最初数小时内为抑制，后则继以较长时间的兴奋。向胃内灌注25%煎剂200ml，则呈兴奋作用。隔离小胃狗试服生姜0.1-1.0g，胃液分泌增加并刺激游离盐酸分泌，但胃蛋白酶对蛋白的消化作用却降低，脂肪酶的作用增强。浸膏能抑制硫酸铜引起的狗的呕吐，服姜汁10-50%30ml也有效，但5%30ml则无效。从生姜中分离出来的姜油酮及姜烯酮的混合物亦有止吐效果，最小有效量为3mg，对阿朴吗啡引起的狗呕吐及洋地黄引起的鸽呕吐均无效。家兔经消化道给予姜油酮可使肠管松弛，蠕动减退。生姜是驱风剂的一种，对消化道有轻度刺激作用，可使肠张力、节律及蠕动增加，有时继之以降低，可用于因胀气或其他原因引起的肠绞痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-tc3anvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-tc3anvt","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对循环和呼吸的作用：正常人口嚼生姜1g（不咽下），可使收缩压平均升高11.2mm汞柱，舒张压上升14mm汞柱，对脉率则无显着影响。酒精提取液对麻醉猫血管运动中枢及呼吸中枢有兴奋作用，对心脏也有直接兴奋作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-zea3nfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-zea3nfp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.抗菌及抗原虫作用：体外试验水浸剂对堇色毛癣菌有抑制作用，对阴道滴虫有杀灭作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-erzgr6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-erzgr6m","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.其他作用：蛙皮下注射、家兔静脉注射大量姜油酮，能引起中枢运动麻痹，对兔有时血压可下降。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-lyxdwuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-lyxdwuj","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-60uffle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-60uffle","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理化鉴别薄层色谱：分取干姜1g，生姜5g磨碎，各加甲醇适量，振摇后静置1h，滤过。滤液浓缩至约1ml，作供试液，以芳樟醇、1，8-按油素为对照品，分别点样于同一硅胶G薄层板上，用石油醚一乙酸乙酯（85：15）展开，以1%香草醛硫酸液里色。供试液色谱在与对照品色谱的相应位置上，显相同的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-6gg9420","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-6gg9420","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志（中华人民共和国药典）1995年版规定：本品含挥发油不得少于0.8%（ml/g）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-5ikif5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-5ikif5z","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-k2n8kdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-k2n8kdx","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.生姜：拣去杂质，洗净泥土，用时切片。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-z21mn6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-z21mn6n","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.鲜姜粉：取鲜生姜，洗净，捣烂，压榨取汁，静置，分取沉淀的粉质，晒干，或低温干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-adrmu2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-adrmu2t","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.煨姜：取净生姜，用纸六、七层包裹，水中浸透，置火灰中煨至纸色焦黄，去纸用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-yneiup3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-yneiup3","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味辛；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-6z65sek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-6z65sek","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；胃；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-mew22z9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-mew22z9","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】散寒解表；降逆止呕；化痰止咳。主风寒感冒；恶寒发热；头痛鼻塞；呕吐；痰饮喘咳；胀满；泄泻"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-rntksz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-rntksz7","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-10g；或捣汁冲。外用：适量，捣敷；或炒热熨；或绞汁调搽搽"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-eyo1fam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-eyo1fam","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】阴虚内热及实热证禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-wp63lc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-wp63lc2","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】生姜泻心汤《伤寒论》；桂枝汤《伤寒论》；生姜甘草汤《备急千金要方》；当归生姜羊肉汤《金匮要略》；生姜半夏汤《金匮要略》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-8szgtof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-8szgtof","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-po789h7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-po789h7","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.成无己：姜、枣味辛甘，专行脾之津液而和营卫，药中用之，不独专于发散也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-4rxc0b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-4rxc0b6","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.李杲：孙真人云，姜为呕家圣药。盖辛以散之，呕乃气逆不散，此药行阳而散气也。俗言上床萝卜下床姜，姜能开胃，萝卜消食也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-xow6koh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-xow6koh","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性类明》：生姜去湿，只是温中益脾胃，脾胃之气温和健运，则湿气自去矣。其消痰者，取其味辛辣，有开豁冲散之功也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-48q0rsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-48q0rsp","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《医学入门》：姜，产后必用者，以其能破血逐瘀也。今人但知为胃药，而不知其能通心肺也。心气通，则一身之气正而邪气不能容，故曰去秽恶，通神明。丹溪云，留皮则冷，去皮则热。非皮之性本冷也，盖留皮则行表而热去，去皮则守中热存耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-ff7yljl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-ff7yljl","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《纲目》：生用发散，熟用和中，解食野禽中毒成喉痹；浸汁点赤眼；捣汁和黄明胶熬，贴风湿痛。姜，辛而不荤，去邪辟恶，生啖，熟食，醋、酱、糟、盐、蜜煎调和，无不宜之，可蔬可茹，可果可药，其利溥矣。凡早行、山行宜含一块，不犯雾露清湿之气，及山岚不正之邪。按方广《心法附馀》云，凡中风、中暑、中气、中毒、中恶、干霍乱、一切卒暴之病，用姜汁与童便服，立可解散，盖姜能开痰下气，童便降火也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-sh3j95q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-sh3j95q","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草经疏》：生姜所禀，与干姜性气无殊，第消痰、止呕、出汗、散风、祛寒、止泄、疏肝、导滞，则功优于干姜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-tcd5d8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-tcd5d8h","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《药品化义》：生姜辛窜，药用善豁痰利窍，止寒呕，去秽气，通神明。助葱白头大散表邪一切风寒湿热之症；合黑枣、柴、甘，所谓辛甘发散为阳，治寒热往来及表虚发热；佐灯心通窍利肺气，宁咳嗽；入补脾药，开胃补脾，止泄泻。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-r0oc8w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-r0oc8w4","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草新编》：姜通神明，古志之矣，然徒用一二片，欲遽通明，亦必不得之数。或用人参，或用白术，或用石菖蒲，或用丹砂，彼此相剂，而后神明可通，邪气可辟也。生姜性散，能散风邪，伤风小恙，何必用桂枝，用生姜三钱捣碎，加薄荷二钱，滚水冲服，邪即时解散。或问生姜发汗，不宜常服，有之乎？曰，生姜四时皆可服，但不宜多服散气，岂特发汗哉。然而多服则正气受伤，少服则正气无害，又不可过于避忌坐视，而不收其功也。至于偶受阴寒，如手足厥逆，腹痛绕脐而不可止，不妨多用生姜，捣碎炒热，熨于心腹之外，以祛其内寒也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-8q2n4ga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-8q2n4ga","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《本草从新》：姜汁，开痰，治噎膈反胃，救暴卒，疗狐臭，搽冻耳。煨姜，和中止呕。煨姜，和中止呕，用生姜惧其散，用干姜惧其燥，惟此略不燥散。凡和中止呕，及与大枣并用，取其和脾胃之津液而和营卫，最为平妥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-d4st2k8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-d4st2k8","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草经读》：仲景桂枝汤等，生姜与大枣同用者，取其辛以和肺卫，得枣之甘以养心营，合之能兼调营卫也。真武汤、茯苓桂枝汤用之者，以辛能利肺气，气行则水利汗止，肺为水之上源也。大小柴胡汤用之者，以其为少阳本经之药也。吴茱萸汤用之者，以其安阳明之气，阳明之气以下行为顺，而呕自止矣；少阴之气，上交阳明中土，而利亦止矣。若人只知其散邪发汗，而不知其有匡正止汗之功，每于真武汤、近效白术汤，辄疑生姜而妄去之，皆读书死于句下之过也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-8tsbceg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-8tsbceg","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本经》：去臭气，通神明。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-u0dp78r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-u0dp78r","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《别录》：主伤寒头痛鼻塞，咳逆上气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-70fmosm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-70fmosm","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.陶弘景：归五脏，去痰下气，止呕吐，除风湿寒热。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-6g7o11t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-6g7o11t","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14.《药性论》：主痰水气满，下气；生与干并治嗽，疗时疾，止呕吐不下食。生和半夏主心下急痛；若中热不能食，捣汁和蜜服之。又汁和杏仁作煎，下一切结气实，心胸壅隔，冷热气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-42e21f3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-42e21f3","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15.《千金·食治》：通汗，去膈上臭气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-qhtgbnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-qhtgbnn","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16.《食疗本草》：除壮热，治转筋、心满。止逆，散烦闷，开胃气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-f7x7ze2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-f7x7ze2","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17.《本草拾遗》：汁解毒药，破血调中，去冷除痰，开胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-upqczwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-upqczwq","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"18.《珍珠囊》：益脾胃，散风寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-3be4o3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-3be4o3u","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"19.《医学启源》：温中去湿。制厚朴、半夏毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-5851a59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-5851a59","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20.《日用本草》：治伤寒、伤风、头痛、九窍不利。入肺开胃，去腹中寒气，解臭秽。解菌蕈诸物毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-jgi94yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-jgi94yh","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"21.《会约医镜》：煨姜，治胃寒，泄泻，吞酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-7ku5g40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-7ku5g40","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"22.《现代实用中药》：治肠疝痛有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240902110746-qxd77q8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110746-qxd77q8","updated":"20240902110814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902110747-jitdglt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902110747-jitdglt","updated":"20240902110814"}},{"ID":"20240902110748-aob84gs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902110748-aob84gs","updated":"20240902110814"}}]}